OL,3,GNEWSAChemotherapy error 'robbed grandad
OL,4,Aof final months'                       
OL,6,FA grandfather never got to meet his    
OL,7,Ffirst grandchild because a chemotherapy
OL,8,Ferror shortened his life, his family   
OL,9,Fhave said.                             
OL,11,FDon Kenny died in May 2023, just weeks 
OL,12,Fbefore the birth of granddaughter Elsie
OL,13,FMay, after receiving the wrong dose of 
OL,14,Fchemotherapy at Walsall Manor Hospital.
OL,16,FThe 61-year-old died up to nine months 
OL,17,Fearlier than expected due to the       
OL,18,Fchemotherapy drug not being mixed      
OL,19,Fcorrectly, a law firm acting for the   
OL,20,Ffamily, FBC Manby Bowdler, said.       
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
